---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Olinske"
  description="Educational and legal disclaimer for Olinske articles and the Reliability Survival Guide."
>
  <main class="container site-shell">
    <section class="hero-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        This site is educational content. It is not legal advice, security advice, or an operational guarantee.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-panel">
      <h2>Use at your own risk</h2>
      <p>
        Reliability guidance must be adapted to your environment, compliance obligations, staffing model, and threat model.
        Test before rollout. Get the right internal approvals. Track whether the advice actually improves outcomes for your systems.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-panel">
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Content is provided as-is. Statistics may be estimates or ranges. Examples are explanatory, not universal. The site does not guarantee correctness, completeness, or suitability for your organization.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-panel">
      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        The preferred public correction path is <a href="https://github.com/FallenHoot/olinske/issues">GitHub Issues</a>.
        Private questions can go to <a href="mailto:hello@olinski.com">hello@olinski.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>